    Negative powers are equivalent to matmul of the inverse:

    >>> inv_a = jnp.linalg.inv(a)
    >>> with jnp.printoptions(precision=3):
    ...   inv_a @ inv_a
    Array([[ 5.5 , -2.5 ],
